{
  "description": "A permission prompt reported only by a Notification (notification_type permission_prompt), as a background agent's prompt is: perm with a placeholder request; a PermissionRequest for the same prompt replaces the request; the tool going ahead ends a prompt only a notification knew of; other notification types change nothing.",
  "provenance": "authored from the research input (Notification permission_prompt) and the hooks reference, not recorded from a live agent",
  "steps": [
